---
// Mission.astro — Why Landwell exists
---

<section id="about" class="mission section">
  <span class="msp msp--1" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
  <span class="msp msp--2" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
  <span class="msp msp--3" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mission__inner">

      <span class="eyebrow">Our story ✦</span>

      <h2 class="mission__heading">
        Built by someone<br>who's been there.
      </h2>

      <div class="mission__body">
        <p>
          Moving to a new country is one of the most disorienting things a person can do.
          The paperwork, the bureaucracy, the systems nobody explains — and underneath all of it,
          a quieter kind of loneliness. The kind that comes from being surrounded by people who
          don't quite understand what it feels like to start from zero.
        </p>
        <p>
          Landwell was born from that feeling. Built by someone who has navigated that confusion
          more than once — and who knows that what makes the real difference isn't just information.
          It's people. The friend who already found the good GP. The neighbour who walked you through
          the bank account process. The stranger in a group chat who replied to your anxious message
          at midnight.
        </p>
        <p>
          We wanted to build that — in one place. A community of people who've already figured it out,
          and who want to hold the door open for the ones just arriving.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mission__sign" aria-hidden="true">♥</p>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mission {
    background: var(--sage-pale);
    position: relative;
  }

  .msp {
    position: absolute;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    animation: msp-float 5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .msp--1 { top: 12%;    left: 6%;   font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.25; animation-delay: 0s; }
  .msp--2 { top: 20%;    right: 5%;  font-size: 0.6rem;  opacity: 0.18; animation-delay: 1.8s; }
  .msp--3 { bottom: 14%; right: 7%;  font-size: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.2;  animation-delay: 3.1s; }

  @keyframes msp-float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); }
    50%       { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(15deg); }
  }

  .mission__inner {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .mission__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(var(--text-3xl), 5.5vw, var(--text-5xl));
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--sage);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .mission__body {
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .mission__body p {
    font-size: clamp(var(--text-base), 1.8vw, var(--text-lg));
    color: var(--text-medium);
    line-height: 1.85;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .mission__sign {
    margin-top: var(--space-12);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    color: var(--terracotta);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
</style>
